# Environment for workflow.py: the workflow's own imports, plus what NOAA-OWP/inundation-mapping's
# inundate_mosaic_wrapper.py imports (commit bf70e85). Compiled to requirements-hand.txt with the versions the
# Ida reference run used:
#   uv pip compile requirements-hand.in -o requirements-hand.txt --python-version 3.12 --constraint <freeze of that env>
# except xarray 2026.9.0 (rioxarray 0.23 needs xarray >= 2026.2; the run itself had 2025.12, pinned for a
# FIMserv fetcher this workflow does not use).
